    "title": "First Mayoral Debate in 2026 Gives Audience Look at Candidates - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Gabriel Ostler ,\n1 days ago FARGO, N.D. (KVRR) – Swaths of prospective voters packed the Fargo Theatre on the evening of April 21st to see the mayoral contenders in action. Four come with connections to Fargo city government – three current commissioners and the Chair of the Human Rights Commission – and one has served in the North Dakota State Legislature since 2012. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
